{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "dist",
  "framework": "vite",
  "headers": [
    {
      "comment": "Las secuencias de frames son ~14 MB. Sin caché larga, cada visita las vuelve a bajar y se come el ancho de banda del plan. Los nombres NO llevan hash, así que no se usa 'immutable': si regenerás los frames, a los 30 días como máximo se refrescan solos.",
      "source": "/(hero|astronauta|fondo)/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/brand/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Vite ya le pone hash a estos nombres, así que acá sí conviene immutable.",
      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "SAMEORIGIN" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
